        "problem": "Calculate $\\lim_\\limits{y\\rightarrow -\\infty} (44-3y^4-9y^{12}) \\, .$",
        "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{y\\to -\\infty }(44-3{y}^{4}-9{y}^{12}) & ={lim}_{y\\to -\\infty }(-9{y}^{12}) \\\\  & =-{lim}_{y\\to -\\infty }({y}^{12}) \\\\  & =-\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$",
